    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Solitaire Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in front of the valkyries and battle through piles of creatures. Play your cards wisely to defeat those evil spirits. Otherwise they will punish you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Deck Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn powerful rewards, make clever decisions and build a deck worthy of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your path through the darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek blessing at the shrine, place risky  bets, or exchange your blood to enhance your deck. Don't miss any opportunity to use the events along your way to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revila</strong> is a single-player card game that combines solitaire mechanics with deck-building and rogue-like elements. Show your skills as the Valkyries offer you different trials, each with a unique deck and play-style. If you prove yourself worthy the Valkyries will uncover your past and might take you to Valhalla. You just have to play your cards wisely!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Solitaire Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in front of the valkyries and battle through piles of creatures. Play your cards wisely to defeat those evil spirits. Otherwise they will punish you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/77a9db051d4f2f5233772b323087db0d.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Deck Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn powerful rewards, make clever decisions and build a deck worthy of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/2c33b647ec1c9c065f387a65b1dc43f5.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your path through the darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek blessing at the shrine, place risky  bets, or exchange your blood to enhance your deck. Don't miss any opportunity to use the events along your way to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.poster.avif?t=1751296494\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.webm?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562170/extras/e5d90e549edb395bd0a18f756fbf608b.mp4?t=1751296494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revila</strong> is a single-player card game that combines solitaire mechanics with deck-building and rogue-like elements. Show your skills as the Valkyries offer you different trials, each with a unique deck and play-style. If you prove yourself worthy the Valkyries will uncover your past and might take you to Valhalla. You just have to play your cards wisely!</p>",
